{"about_the_game":"<strong>Defeat onrushing zombies with tools from the home improvement center!</strong><br><br>&quot;Suddenly the zombies are everywhere and the world has collapsed. You escaped to a home improvement store, but they found you, and now all you have to do is to kill as many zombies as you can.&quot;<br><br>This is a third-person action game set in a home improvement center where a variety of products are lined up, and the player uses the tools that can be picked up there as weapons to defeat zombies.<br>Axes, shovels, hammers, iron pipes, square timbers, kitchen knives, gardening tools, power tools, and much more.<br>Each weapon in the game has its own unique usability, so players can have fun finding the right weapon for themselves and finding the right fighting style for each weapon.<br>With these tools, you can beat the zombies to a pulp with no regrets.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Fight back against","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2283400/ef15dcbcbfd687919c8c8374ca59bae5c0d82efb.jpg"},{"name":"Kill them again.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2283400/691b10e8631b0e854f94445c0911c71d8d9bbbca.jpg"},{"name":"Zombie Buster.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2283400/615e7d494171f7ebc0f30ffb9372264d06ef48e7.jpg"},{"name":"Zombie Sweeper.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2283400/1f38d90138d40fa64115b1e878fca98a297ed1f3.jpg"},{"name":"Sharp Edge.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2283400/91601e4c5042c4713fa6c5f01c93df8dd26199cc.jpg"},{"name":"Knife User.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2283400/b2fa5f8982c2417b6c89691d6f593ed982f4b947.jpg"},{"name":"Master of Knife.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2283400/ff7448004ee37fc1c86855c48ad